---
import AboutHeroImage from "../assets/photo.png";
import Layout from "../layouts/About.astro";
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION } from "../consts";
---

<Layout
    title="Home"
    description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}
    pubDate={new Date("August 08 2021")}
    heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>

    <p>
        I'm Maciej Szalewicz, a business systems professional.
    </p>

    <p>
        My work sits at the intersection of business and software engineering, bridging the gap between stakeholders and development teams by translating business objectives into clear, actionable technical requirements.
    </p>

    <p>
        Over the years, I've worked on projects across the financial sector, contributing to initiatives involving business process analysis, system analysis, regulatory technology, operational improvements, and enterprise-scale transformation. I enjoy understanding how organizations operate, identifying inefficiencies, and designing solutions that make processes more reliable, scalable, and data-driven.
    </p>

    <p>
        Areas of focus include business and system analysis, software architecture, databases, process optimization, data analysis, enterprise systems, and the practical application of AI.
    </p>
</Layout>